  itemDescription: Wellness Technologies & Preventative Medicine Institute  Founding
    Black Seed Company to develop and produce an anti-brain cancer treatment  This
    institute focuses on disease prevention and public health technologies. Its mission
    is to develop vaccines, diagnostics, and health interventions that prevent illness
    rather than only treat it. Key areas include epidemiology, infectious disease
    control, vaccine technology, and health monitoring systems. The institute also
    works on public health research (e.g. nutrition, exercise, and early screening
    programs) to reduce risk factors and incidence of diseases in the population.
    Ultimately, it aims to shift healthcare in Saudi Arabia towards preventive care
    and early intervention
